# web-dispatch

- Vite + React; lint with `oxlint` (`npm run lint`), smoke with `npm test`.
- Health pill wording: Connected / Auth failed / Offline — see `fleetHealthLabel.ts` (parity with Mac).
- Never paste operator ORS keys into the Bearer field; Bearer is `--api-key` / org token only.
- Dev proxy: base URL `http://127.0.0.1:5173/fleet` → fleet server `:8080`.
- Prefer existing MapLibre patterns in `TripMapPreview.tsx`; avoid new dashboard chrome.
